      "id": "kp01-02-map",
      "slot": "concept",
      "kind": "compare-card",
      "title": "同样是整数：编号用来识别，数量才适合求和",
      "panels": [
        {
          "label": "把商品编号相加",
          "tone": "bad",
          "columns": [
            "product_id"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              1
            ],
            [
              2
            ],
            [
              3
            ],
            [
              4
            ],
            [
              5
            ],
            [
              6
            ]
          ],
          "big": {
            "label": "SUM(product_id)",
            "value": 21
          },
          "check": {
            "sql": "SELECT SUM(product_id) FROM products",
            "expected": [
              [
                21
              ]
            ]
          },
          "note": "编号只是识别用的名字，加起来没有业务意义。"
        },
        {
          "label": "把库存数量相加",
          "tone": "good",
          "columns": [
            "stock"
